#  What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to the Cloud Build staging bucket.
#
#  That bucket is a general-purpose one: it has none of the prefix conditions,
#  and none of the per-source IAM, that the evidence bucket has. Everything the
#  build context carries is readable by the build identity and by every project
#  Editor -- so the rule here is that source goes up and material does not.
#
#  Without this file, gcloud synthesises one from .gitignore, which is about
#  what belongs in version control and is a different question.

.git/
.gitignore

#  **The sources' own material, and verification output.** Neither belongs in a
#  general-purpose staging bucket: a deployed source reads its material out of
#  the private bucket under its own identity, and no image copies it.
packages/muster-agents/fixtures/
infra/evidence/

#  Nothing here is built into either image.
spec/
docs/
bench/
packages/muster-kernel/tests/
packages/muster-agents/agent_tests/
packages/muster-platform/tests/acceptance/
packages/muster-platform/tests/adversarial/
packages/muster-platform/tests/architecture/
packages/muster-platform/tests/contract/
packages/muster-platform/tests/golden/
packages/muster-platform/tests/integration/
packages/muster-platform/tests/property/
packages/muster-platform/tests/unit/

#  **What is deliberately kept**, and why each one is not material:
#
#    demo/cloud_hero.py                     the control plane's composition root
#    packages/muster-platform/tests/support the worked case, its keys and its
#                                           publications -- a synthetic fixture,
#                                           checked on every commit, and the
#                                           reason the demonstrated run and the
#                                           tested run are one case
#    packages/muster-kernel/fixtures        the case files that fixture reads
#
#  All three are synthetic and none of them is a source's private material.

#  Local state.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.specvenv-z3/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
.import_linter_cache/
*.pem
*.key
# Frontend is not part of the agent/control-plane container images.
packages/muster-ui/